    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "After a long pursuit of justice for those harmed, regulators are holding the entity prioritizing its own services accountable for inadequate fixes, rejecting its remedy proposals. The authority is now finalizing a financial penalty—expected to reach the high hundreds of millions of euros—aimed at correcting past harm to smaller businesses squeezed out by self-preferencing in search results. This action adds to a pattern of accountability for a corporation that has caused repeated harm, delivering a timely resolution before the break.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Caregiver",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-1",
          "result-0",
          "result-1"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.91
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "Protectors of market fairness in the EU regulatory authority are imposing a major financial sanction on a gatekeeper company for suppressing smaller rivals who deserve visibility. After rejecting proposed remedies, they are securing substantial recompense for those disadvantaged, with the penalty finalization adding to a history of regulatory fines against the parent company. This pattern of accountability underscores the duty to shelter smaller businesses from unfair competitive practices under protective regulations for fair competition.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Caregiver",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-0",
          "how-1",
          "result-1"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.85
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "In a jurisdiction protecting smaller businesses, the seat of protective policy-making is dismissing attempts to shield the corporation with a history of harm from responsibility. This enforcement action, under competition law, aims to correct harm from self-preferencing in search results that unfairly disadvantaged businesses. The resulting punitive financial outcome represents a necessary step to repair the market and nurture fair opportunity for all online services.",
